        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Terry Kilgore\n- Places: Cumberland Gap\n- Organizations: Virginia House of Delegates\n- Roles: chair of the Commerce and Labor committee\n- Topics: Republican Party affiliation\n\nFacts:\n- Terry Kilgore is a Republican.\n- Terry Kilgore was elected to the Virginia House of Delegates in 1993.\n- Terry Kilgore became chair of the Commerce and Labor committee in 2008.\n- Cumberland Gap is a narrow pass through the ridge of the Cumberland Mountains within the Appalachian Mountains.\n- Cumberland Gap is near the junction of the U.S. states of Kentucky, Virginia, and Tennessee.",
